  message: "mulul run 2026-10-03, branch jgstern-agent/fix/mulul-catalogue-rows (local only), commit e94b1aace0: LOOKPATH HALF ONLY. os/exec.LookPath and community golang.org/x/sys/execabs.LookPath moved subprocess -> fs_read (python shutil.which parity; it stats PATH candidates); their two high-risk exemptions removed. Repro (go fixture exec.LookPath(os.Getenv(\"TOOL\")), nothing run): no-subprocess and host_secret->subprocess VIOLATED -> CONFIRMED; the opaque_boundary caveat on four other claims is gone. Corpus io-boundaries A/B: docker-compose 1 and runc 3 LookPath chains moved subprocess -> fs_read, no other boundary count changed. THIS ITEM STAYS OPEN for Command / CommandContext (and the execabs twins): deliberately untouched, an ADR-0049 ruling-3 crossing that waits for WI-kozaj; a control test (test_go_lookpath_is_not_a_launch.py) pins them as subprocess so the branch cannot be read as having decided that half. Report: decontend/run_10032026/mulul.md."  # c487
